<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation falls to 7.48 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation falls to 7.48 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index fell to 7.48 percent in the week ending January 18 from 7.64 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said on Sunday.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES   Jan 18, 1997  Jan 11, 1997  Jan 20, 1996</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +7.48	   +7.64	   +5.00</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)   320.4	   319.8	   298.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended January 20, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
